"Note: Replace domain, group, and EndpointURL with the appropriate values for"
" your onboarding environment."
msgstr ""
"Примечание. Замените domain, group и EndpointURL значениями, "
"соответствующими вашей среде регистрации."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L758
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
