#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/decision_support.md#L185
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/decision_support.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/decision_support.html
#: input/pagecontent/decision_support.md:185
msgid "CQL Execution"
msgstr "Выполнение CQL"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/decision_support.md#L70
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/decision_support.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/decision_support.html
#: input/pagecontent/decision_support.md:70
msgid ""
"CQL expresses the logic of business rules in a way that is both human "
"readable and computable. The logic must be written against a common standard"
" format for representing the credentials for the logic to be computed "
"against health credentials in a scalable and standardized way."
msgstr ""
"CQL выражает логику бизнес-правил в форме, которая одновременно удобочитаема"
" для человека и вычислима. Чтобы логику можно было вычислять применительно к"
" медицинским удостоверениям масштабируемым и стандартизированным образом, "
"она должна быть написана в соответствии с общим стандартным форматом "
"представления удостоверений."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/decision_support.md#L125
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/decision_support.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/decision_support.html
#: input/pagecontent/decision_support.md:125
msgid "CQL for Health Credentials"
msgstr "CQL для медицинских удостоверений"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/decision_support.md#L101
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/decision_support.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/decision_support.html
#: input/pagecontent/decision_support.md:101
msgid ""
"CQL libraries can also contain terminology declarations, including "
"codesystems and valuesets. These declarations allow the CQL to define a "
