#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/dsa_processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:177
msgid ""
"I's server gets tokens by client credentials over mutual TLS (RFC 8705) and "
"calls the API"
msgstr ""
"Сервер I получает токены по схеме client credentials через взаимную "
"аутентификацию TLS (RFC 8705) и вызывает API"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
