#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/dsa_processes.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/dsa_processes.html
#: input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md:120
msgid "ICVP, IPS-PILGRIMAGE and PH4H. It has no trust domain for DSAs."
msgstr "ICVP, IPS-PILGRIMAGE и PH4H. Доверенного домена для DSA в ней нет."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/dsa_processes.md#L181
