msgid ""
"Regi-TRUST is built on the open-source Trust mAnagement INfrastructure "
"(TRAIN), developed by the Fraunhofer IAO as a part of the European Self-"
"Sovereign Identity Framework (ESSIF) Lab. TRAIN uses/supports several "
"established standards and is flexible with existing architectures, providing"
" technical accessibility and inclusivity for implementors."
msgstr ""
"Regi-TRUST построена на основе инфраструктуры управления доверием с открытым"
" исходным кодом Trust mAnagement INfrastructure (TRAIN), разработанной "
"Fraunhofer IAO в рамках лаборатории European Self-Sovereign Identity "
"Framework (ESSIF) Lab. TRAIN использует/поддерживает ряд устоявшихся "
"стандартов и гибко сочетается с существующими архитектурами, обеспечивая "
"техническую доступность и инклюзивность для разработчиков реализаций."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/reference_implementation.md#L38
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/reference_implementation.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/reference_implementation.html
#: input/pagecontent/reference_implementation.md:38
